 ## Operating characteristics
-- **Time Complexity:** Insertion, removal, and existence checks in the `HashSet` are $O(1)$ on average. Rendering is $O(V)$ where $V$ is the number of voxels, as it iterates over the entire set.
-- **Memory Complexity:** $O(V)$, storing only the coordinates of occupied voxels.
